WEBVTT

00:26:29.519 --> 00:26:32.458
and then over time, sort of,
shoots the company in the foot?

00:26:33.663 --> 00:26:36.768
DF: Well, this will definitely make
for an interesting case study,

00:26:36.792 --> 00:26:39.952
because we've kind of got the full cycle.

00:26:41.347 --> 00:26:42.975
Look, I really --

00:26:42.999 --> 00:26:44.903
Coming back to the question on belief,

00:26:44.927 --> 00:26:46.545
I believe he believed it.

00:26:47.872 --> 00:26:52.273
I think he had other things
that drove that belief system

00:26:52.297 --> 00:26:54.029
and his ambitions

00:26:54.053 --> 00:26:56.519
of things he wanted to achieve,

00:26:56.543 --> 00:26:58.583
which, honestly,
he achieved a lot of them.